# bakeware.voc — Bakeware nouns: 'forma DE <bolo/tarte/pudim…>' = a baking mould (closed-o
# NOUN), as opposed to 'a forma do bolo' = shape (open-o VERB). Only counted
# ADJACENT to 'forma de'. Add tins/items a mould is named after.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

bolo
gelado
gelo
madalenas
pao
pudim
pão
queijo
queques
sapateiro
tarte
